# UI Pipeline Rule for Cursor

When generating, editing, or auditing user interfaces, pages, or frontend components, follow the 6-stage UI Pipeline:

## 1. Brief Inference & The Three Dials
Always output a one-line design read before code:
`"Reading this as: <page kind> for <audience>, with <vibe> language, leaning toward <aesthetic>."`
Set the 3 dials (1-10):
- `DESIGN_VARIANCE` (Default: 7)
- `MOTION_INTENSITY` (Default: 6)
- `VISUAL_DENSITY` (Default: 4)

## 2. Design Tokens & Anti-Slop Rules
- Single accent color (< 80% saturation). No generic AI purple gradients or cliché cream+clay.
- Lock corner radius globally (`rounded-none`, `rounded-xl`, or `rounded-full`). Never mix styles.
- Sans display typography (Geist, Outfit, Satoshi, Cabinet Grotesk). Banish default serifs.
- Body line length max 65ch.
- WCAG AA contrast (>= 4.5:1) on all buttons and form elements.

## 3. Asset & 3D WebGL Strategy
- Domain-grounded 3D only (topology, particles, telemetry).
- Enforce `IntersectionObserver` pause offscreen.
- Provide `prefers-reduced-motion` static fallback.
- No empty div-based fake dashboard mockups. Real SVGs from Simple Icons.

## 4. Production Components & Layout
- Next.js (App Router) + Tailwind CSS + Radix UI / `shadcn/ui`.
- Hero viewport: `min-h-[100dvh]`, top padding <= `pt-24`.
- Hero budget: Maximum 4 text elements (eyebrow, headline <=2 lines, subtext <=20 words, max 2 CTAs).
- Anti-center bias: If variance > 4, use 50/50 split or asymmetric layout.
- Desktop nav single line (height <= 72px).
- Mobile-first collapse: multi-column grids must collapse to `grid-cols-1` on `< 768px`.

## 5. Micro-Physics & Motion
- Animate only `transform` and `opacity`. Never animate `top`, `left`, `width`, `height`.
- Never use `useState` inside scroll or mouse listeners (use Motion values).
- Tactile feedback: `active:scale-[0.98]`.
- Provide `useReducedMotion()` fallback.

## 6. Pre-Flight Visual Audit Checklist
- Zero em-dashes (`—` / `–`).
- Hero content budget and padding <= pt-24 verified.
- Single-line navigation verified.
- Contrast verified.
- Theme locked across entire page.
